## Usage

{% if has_python or has_node or has_go or has_rust or has_dotnet %}
{% if has_python %}
```bash
uv sync
{% if python_scaffolding == 'application' %}
uv run python -m {{ repo_name | replace('-', '_') }}
{% else %}
uv run python -m {{ repo_name | replace('-', '_') }} --help
{% endif %}
```

{% elif has_node %}
```bash
{{ node_install_cmd }}
{% if is_node_publishable and node_build != 'none' %}
{{ node_build_cmd }}
{% endif %}
```
{% if is_node_publishable %}
Import the package by name; its entrypoints are declared in `package.json`
under `exports`.
{% else %}
